WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.000
Sara and Rex dragged a log.

2
00:00:14.001 --> 00:00:21.539
"Our bridge will be strong," Sid said.

3
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.080
"Hey!" Sara yelled.

4
00:00:24.081 --> 00:00:26.648
"Someone is under my hat!"

5
00:00:26.649 --> 00:00:30.808
A toad peeked out.

6
00:00:30.809 --> 00:00:34.487
"Who are you?" Sara asked.

7
00:00:34.488 --> 00:00:39.066
"I'm Nate," the toad said.

8
00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:46.478
"That's my hat, Nate!" Sara said.

9
00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:48.209
"Shoo!"

10
00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:56.426
"Ugh!" Nate hopped away.

11
00:00:56.427 --> 00:01:04.838
Sara went back to work.

12
00:01:04.839 --> 00:01:07.296
Nate came back.

13
00:01:07.297 --> 00:01:12.527
He hid under Sara's hat again.

14
00:01:12.528 --> 00:01:19.800
"Nate!" Sara said.

15
00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:22.190
Tor took Sara's hat.

16
00:01:22.191 --> 00:01:25.400
She flew up to a tree.

17
00:01:25.401 --> 00:01:28.560
She hung up the hat.

18
00:01:28.561 --> 00:01:37.067
Nate hopped away.

19
00:01:37.068 --> 00:01:41.302
Tor lifted a log with Sid.

20
00:01:41.303 --> 00:01:45.084
"Ouch!" she said.

21
00:01:45.085 --> 00:01:57.340
"I hurt my wing."

22
00:01:57.341 --> 00:02:03.935
Soon the bridge was done.

23
00:02:03.936 --> 00:02:07.194
"I need my hat," Sara said.

24
00:02:07.195 --> 00:02:10.110
"I'll get it," Tor said.

25
00:02:10.111 --> 00:02:17.810
"Ouch!" Tor rubbed her wing.

26
00:02:17.811 --> 00:02:22.161
"Oh no! I can't fly!"

